<title>USA: General Dynamics Corp Q3 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>General Dynamics Corp Q3 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>FALLS CHURCH, Va. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		     $   1.08		 $   1.45</p>
<p> Oper shr		    1.08		     0.99</p>
<p> Net			 68,000		   91,000</p>
<p> Oper net		  68,000		   62,000</p>
<p> Revs		     862,000		  718,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  63,100		   63,300</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		     $   3.16		 $   3.70</p>
<p> Oper shr		    3.16		     2.91</p>
<p> Net			200,000		  233,000</p>
<p> Oper net		 200,000		  183,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,685,000		2,174,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  63,200		   63,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Total net earning for the 1995 third quarter includes $29 million associated with discontinued operations.</p>
<p>The firm's funded backlog for the end of Q3 was $5.6 billion; total backlog was $10 billion. At the end of the 1995 Q3, funded backlog was $6 billion, and total backlog was $7.8 billion.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
